+"""Integration tests for mindmap branch status feature.
+
+Tests the real MCP tools against a live Postgres pool:
+- mindmap_resolve: resolve/drop branches with and without resolving nodes
+- open_loops: only counts owner-turn nodes with status='open'
+- mindmap_get: cheap reads with since/cursor, include/all, depth/summary
+- migration CHECK constraints
+"""
+
